  "size": @SIZE@,
  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.31 improves GNOME restore scheduling: groups application windows, avoids fresh-launch gaps for reused apps, wakes readiness on signals, shares bounded late-layout retries, and indexes exact window matches. Retains conservative launch and settle pacing, serialized compositor operations, crash checkpoints and unresolved records. Includes paired tiling, shutdown recovery and autostart fixes."
